                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was great to hear from WNC native Josh Dobson, the new CEO of North Carolina Healthcare Association. We discussed budget reconciliation and federal funding for healthcare.\n\u00a0\nAs a member of the House Budget Committee, it\u2019s important to me to get input from North Carolina leaders and stakeholders as we begin the budget reconciliation process.",
