                "text": "MYTH: Illegal immigrants are not on Medicaid.\n\nFACT: CBO data shows that the budget reconciliation bill would remove at least 1.4 million illegal aliens who are on taxpayer-funded programs, including Medicaid, strengthening those programs for Americans who need them. #MythBuster",
