                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Matthew Dickerson of the Economic Policy Innovation Center just testified to the House Budget Committee that $1,100,000,000,000 was misspent in  Medicaid over the last decade. Rooting out waste, fraud, and abuse will help us cover the truly vulnerable poor, children, elderly, and disabled.",
