                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The American people can rest assured knowing that Medicaid will be strengthened and streamlined - reducing waste, fraud, and abuse - so that it continues to serve our nation\u2019s most vulnerable populations. https://t.co/A22cBznEfo",
